            {
              "_type": "UMLConstraintView",
              "_id": "AAAAAAGhZUHrWKNIA7c=",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "488acd8e76b5593fba0400901f19511c"
              },
              "model": {
                "$ref": "0ffd59ca981858eb94aed3e32ef8bdb4"
              },
              "lineColor": "#202020",
              "fillColor": "#fffef3",
              "fontColor": "#111111",
              "font": "Arial;16;0",
              "parentStyle": false,
              "showShadow": false,
              "left": 3278.0859375,
              "top": 1994,
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 220,
              "text": "{SHIPPING (USD per art piece)\nAll art: base 10.99. Drawing and Print: base only.\nSculpture: 10.99 + 0.20 * weightOunces.\nPainting: area = height * width (square inches).\narea <100: +5.99; 100<=area<=300: +10.99; area>300: +15.99.\nTransaction quote = sum of each art price + its shipping.}"
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLConstraintView",
              "_id": "AAAAAAGhZUHrcqNX4V0=",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "488acd8e76b5593fba0400901f19511c"
              },
              "model": {
                "$ref": "e80d2ebf28ac5186a90fe6652f394ec3"
              },
              "lineColor": "#202020",
              "fillColor": "#fffef3",
              "fontColor": "#111111",
              "font": "Arial;16;0",
              "parentStyle": false,
              "showShadow": false,
              "left": 3278.0859375,
              "top": 1374,
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 260,
              "text": "{COMPLETION RESPONSIBILITIES\nArtManager.completeTransaction(transactionId) locates the transaction,\nrejects missing/completed records, and checks EVERY art ID against inventory.\nAny failure leaves inventory and transaction unchanged. Prepare total/date\nbefore mutation; perform no file I/O in the commit.\nTransaction.completeTransaction() assigns its date and stored total once.\nOnly after successful completion does ArtManager remove all purchased art.\nValidation/commit is one non-interleaved in-memory operation.}"
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLConstraintView",
              "_id": "AAAAAAGhZUHrjqNmVaE=",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "488acd8e76b5593fba0400901f19511c"
              },
              "model": {
                "$ref": "37615d9733ea548c9f9c84940f0341c0"
              },
              "lineColor": "#202020",
              "fillColor": "#fffef3",
              "fontColor": "#111111",
              "font": "Arial;16;0",
              "parentStyle": false,
              "showShadow": false,
              "left": 100,
              "top": 1782,
              "width": 1600,
              "height": 230,
              "text": "{ART CONSTRUCTION AND IMMUTABILITY\nid is exactly 10 decimal digits; yearCreated is a year; description <=500 chars.\nAll common and subtype values are required; no Art setters.\nSubclass constructors pass inherited arguments to super.\nPainting/Drawing/Print category: history, portrait, genre, landscape, still life.\nPrint editionType: canvas, paper, photo. Styles/techniques/materials are open text.\nAll four calculateShippingCost(): double operations override Art.}"
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLConstraintView",
              "_id": "AAAAAAGhZUHrrKN1nqg=",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "488acd8e76b5593fba0400901f19511c"
              },
              "model": {
                "$ref": "08b4044fb2425fdc8030b8061027880e"
              },
              "lineColor": "#202020",
              "fillColor": "#fffef3",
              "fontColor": "#111111",
              "font": "Arial;16;0",
              "parentStyle": false,
              "showShadow": false,
              "left": 3278.0859375,
              "top": 1684,
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 260,
              "text": "{TRANSACTION AND CUSTOMER DATA\nUI supplies the unique transaction ID. Require Customer and >=1 Art.\ntransactionDate == null means incomplete. Only completion sets date/price.\nAfter completion: no edits/removal; date/price/ID have no public setters.\nCustomer values are mutable, but Transaction copies customer data on input/\noutput and protects its completed snapshot. Art-list and Date getters copy.\nThe five-argument constructor restores saved state without replaying a sale.\nText-file loading preserves both incomplete and completed transactions.\nArt IDs in artPieces are unique; duplicate additions fail before mutation.}"
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLConstraintView",
              "_id": "AAAAAAGhZUHrzKOEZ5g=",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "488acd8e76b5593fba0400901f19511c"
              },
              "model": {
                "$ref": "2ef898f3b2055cf59c17c09ddae031e3"
              },
              "lineColor": "#202020",
              "fillColor": "#fffef3",
              "fontColor": "#111111",
              "font": "Arial;16;0",
              "parentStyle": false,
              "showShadow": false,
              "left": 3278.0859375,
              "top": 2264,
              "width": 1400,
              "height": 300,
              "text": "{RELATIONSHIPS AND EXCEPTIONS\nHollow diamonds denote shared aggregation at the whole. No exclusive\npart lifetime is specified, so no composition is invented.\nArt/Transaction may exist before manager admission; Art survives in sales.\nEach Transaction has exactly 1 Customer and at least 1 Art; either part may\nbe referenced by multiple transactions.\nInventory add/remove failures: InvalidArtOperationException.\nTransaction add/remove/edit failures: InvalidTransOperationException.\nCompletion failures: InvalidTransactionException. Messages include operation, ID, reason.}"
            }
          ]
        },
