          "name": "Art",
          "documentation": "All six values required at creation, id is exactly 10 decimal digits (String preserves leading zeroes), description length <=500, yearCreated is a year. No editing interfaces. Art constructor initializes inherited values through super. No inventory-management responsibility.",
