          ],
          "documentation": "Manages inventory and transactions only. Noarg construction allows independently loading either file after startup; filename constructor loads both. Text files include completed and incomplete transactions. Completion validates transaction eligibility and every requested art ID against current inventory before any mutation. Prepare price/date without mutation; then commit transaction completion and remove validated inventory items as one non-interleaved in-memory operation. Any validation/calculation failure leaves both collections and transaction unchanged. No fallible file I/O in completion. saveInventory/saveTransactions are explicit. retrieveTransactionsByDate uses the supplied Date value to select matching transaction dates. Queries return list copies. No login, UI, database or payment implementation. Load validation preserves unique inventory art IDs and transaction IDs before publishing loaded data. Completion preflight also rejects repeated requested art IDs before quoting or mutating.",
          "attributes": [
            {
              "_type": "UMLAttribute",
              "_id": "8cb6ac85623c5b88bd3c9776e2880821",
              "_parent": {
